Package: aBKMR
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Bayesian Kernel Machine Regression  for Large-Scale Exposome Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Yi Guo
Maintainer: Yi Guo <yguo24@m.fudan.edu.cn>
Description: Provides an implementation of Advanced Bayesian Kernel Machine Regression
    for large-scale exposome data. It dramatically reduces both computation time and memory usage. The package also offers functions for
    visualizing univariate, bivariate, and multivariate exposure
    response surfaces in R..
